                <pb facs="0596" n="1250" sameAs="frus:frus1875v02/pg1250"/>

                <head>No. 590.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Cushing to Mr. Fish</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Madrid</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1875-03-09"><hi rendition="#italic">March</hi> 9,
                        1875</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Officious agreement has been signed, substantially as telegraphed on the 2d.
                    Credentials to be presented on the 10th.</p>
                <closer><signed>CUSHING.</signed></closer>
            </div>
